WEBVTT

00:06:59.707 --> 00:07:02.793
This is being coupled
with advancements in infrastructure.

00:07:02.835 --> 00:07:06.547
In recent decades,
engineers have realized new ways

00:07:06.589 --> 00:07:08.924
to harness stormwater.

00:07:08.966 --> 00:07:12.761
Green stormwater infrastructure,
like the one shown here,

00:07:12.803 --> 00:07:15.848
mitigates the flood pulse
while cleaning stormwater,

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:18.601
using tools from the soil and plants.

00:07:18.601 --> 00:07:22.396
Infiltration, evaporation
and transpiration --

00:07:22.396 --> 00:07:24.940
this has been shown
to be effective and efficient

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.735
in meeting federal water regulations,

00:07:27.735 --> 00:07:30.488
and is surprisingly cost-effective, too.